# Sub-tick interpolation of Zoe's zap (scripts/check_zap_subtick.sh).
#   <source> | <V> | [tol=<px>] [step=<px>]
# <source> is a movie under games/spyro-3/bk2, or a name not ending in .bk2,
# which is the plain boot replayed with no input. V is the tick whose
# primitives the intermediate present at V+1 replays; V-2 opens the interval.
#
# The zap's records are spawned by the level overlays' Zoe update, so the pool
# is empty wherever Zoe is not zapping: none of the bk2 rows holds a live
# record, and the plain boot holds exactly one from VBL 4901 to 4921. Inside
# that window the record's head sweeps while its tail stays anchored, and the
# interval closing at 4905 carries the largest canonical motion of the window,
# 109.50 px at the head against 1.21 px at the tail. Both ends are judged: the
# head prices the sweep and the tail proves the anchored end is not dragged
# along with it.
title-demo-zap | 4905 | tol=0.5 step=4
